    "title": "More last-resort aid coming to West Valley veterans - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago A little more money is going toward helping local veterans in need for things like rent and utilities, thanks to the Maricopa County Community College District Foundation. A little more money is going toward helping local veterans in need for things like rent and utilities, thanks to the Maricopa County Community College District Foundation.\nSurprise will be reimbursed up to $24,370 this fiscal year for services it provides to veterans at its new Surprise Community and Resource Center in the Original Town Site at 12641 W. Santa Fe Drive.\nThe community college district gives Surprise some grant money each year to serve all West Valley veterans.\n1",
